[en.FOCUS_C12_LARGER_BEASTS]
Larger Beasts

[en.FOCUS_C12_LARGER_BEASTS_desc]
Relying on soldiers to wage war is a thing of the past; the future of warfare belongs to these roaring, steam-powered steel behemoths. Our focus should be on researching these colossal machines, for they are destined to be unstoppable.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LARGER_BEASTS]
更庞大的巨兽

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LARGER_BEASTS_desc]
依靠士兵去作战的方式已经过时，战争的未来属于这些嘶吼着蒸汽的钢铁巨兽。我们的精力应该置力于研究这些最庞大的家伙，它们将所向披靡。

